## What This Adds

**4 Architectural Overrides:**
- Bloc/Cubit (not ChangeNotifier)
- Freezed everywhere (domain, DTOs, Bloc states/events)
- very_good_analysis (stricter than flutter_lints)
- Flavors (dev/staging/prod from day one)

**Project Structure:**
- `docs/adr/` — 8 ADRs documenting each decision
- `lib/` — Layered scaffold (config, data, domain, routing, ui, utils)
- `analysis_options.yaml` — Lint config
- `.github/workflows/flutter-ci.yml` — CI pipeline

**Dependencies:** flutter_bloc, freezed, go_router, very_good_analysis, mocktail

